          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.549,
          "bottom": 0.588,
          "x0": 104.9,
          "cw": 8.28
        },
        {
          "text": "• Parent can wait for threads to finish (optional)",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.59,
          "bottom": 0.63,
          "x0": 90.1,
          "cw": 6.93
        },
        {
          "text": "• Several such threading libraries exist in different",
          "kind": "text",
